<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Materials cuts lead price by 5,000 yen.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Materials cuts lead price by 5,000 yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Materials Corp said on Wednesday it has cut its selling price for lead by 5,000 yen to 116,000 yen per tonne, effective from today.</p>
<p>Major Japanese smelters periodically review their selling prices, changing them in line with market prices and currency rates.</p>
</text>
